COMMANDS:
docker images: to show a list of images
docker pull ubuntu: to get ubuntu image
docker run ubuntu: to create a container
docker run -it --name cont2 ubuntu: it will create cont2 with interactive mode
docker ps -a: to show list of containers including stopped containers
docker ps: to list the running containers
docker image inspect image-name:tag : to check which port that image is exposing
docker build -t image-name path-to-Dockerfile: build an image from Dockerfile
docker run -itd --name con1 -p 1111:80 img1: to create a container con1 from img1 in a interactive terminal with detached(background app running) port 1111 and image exposed to port 80
docker exec -it container-name path-to-run : login into the container

